# Dev tooling & image generation (not part of the shipped mod)
# (tools/* rather than tools/ so the exception below can be reached -- git will not
# descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so a negation inside one never matches.)
tools/*
# ...except the performance harness: its baseline.json is only worth anything if it
# travels with the repo, so a regression shows up as a diff in review.
!tools/perf/

# Internal/dev notes not shipped with the mod
docs/texturepack.md
docs/informe-revision.md
docs/purifier-plan.md
docs/directional-flow-plan.md

# Claude Code / AI assistant artifacts
.claude/

# Working notes and handover documents. Useful while the work is live, not part of the mod.
docs/
